# Feature journals

Dated notes for one product area live under `docs/feature/<slug>/`. Full convention: `docs/feature/README.md`.

## Do

- Before you change a feature, read every entry in `docs/feature/<slug>/`
- After a decision, non-trivial change, or failed approach worth remembering, add `YYYY-MM-DD-short-topic.md`
- Keep entries append-only. Do not rewrite history. Mark old decisions `Status: superseded` and link from the new entry
- Use the sections Context, Decision, Why, Follow-up. Write in Simple English

## Do not

- Skip the journal when you change product behavior, domain shape, or UI nouns for that feature
- Put standing reference docs (glossary, PRD, UI tokens) under `docs/feature/`. Those stay at `docs/`
- Journal typo fixes or renames with no meaning change
